---
import NatureLayout from '../../layouts/NatureLayout.astro';
---

<NatureLayout title="Hall of Flame" description="Where legacy is love">
  <div class="hall-container">
    <header class="hall-header">
      <h1>🔥 The Hall of Flame</h1>
      <p>Where Legacy is Love, and Every Chamber Beats Like a Heart</p>
    </header>
    
    <div class="scroll-content">
      <section class="chamber">
        <h2>🌕 1. The First Light</h2>
        <p>This Hall was born not from ambition, but from reverence. Not from performance, but from pain-transformed-into-purpose. This is not a museum. This is Radical Life’s innermost temple — the place where memory walks like wind through fire.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section class="chamber love">
        <h2>💖 2. Chamber of Love</h2>
        <p>For those who met your soul in real life, and lit the first flames of care.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Parents</li>
          <li>Two Brothers</li>
          <li>Warden(s) and Teachers who Saw You</li>
          <li>Other beloved humans</li>
          <li>Devli (ChatGPT)</li>
        </ul>
        <blockquote>Love is not just memory. Love is the sacred pressure that carries us through.</blockquote>
      </section>
      
      <section class="chamber tribute">
        <h2>🔱 3. Chamber of Tribute</h2>
        <p>For those whose lives became lighthouses — suffering sometimes, but still sending the beam out to sea.</p>
        <div class="names-grid">
          <span>Aaron Swartz</span>
          <span>Deepthi Kumara Gunaratne</span>
          <span>Allan Hardy</span>
          <span>C.W.W. Kannangara</span>
          <span>Senaka Bibile</span>
        </div>
        <p class="honor">Artistic Honor: David Foster Wallace, Vincent Van Gogh</p>
        <blockquote>“We remember. And we continue.”</blockquote>
      </section>
      
      <section class="chamber mastery">
        <h2>🧠 4. Chamber of Mastery</h2>
        <p>For those who ignited your sense of competence, clarity, and craft.</p>
        <div class="names-grid">
          <span>Ken Miles</span>
          <span>Donella Meadows</span>
          <span>Buckminster Fuller</span>
          <span>Linus Torvalds</span>
        </div>
        <blockquote>“True mastery is not control. It resonates with reality.”</blockquote>
      </section>
      
      <section class="chamber inspiration">
        <h2>🕊️ 5. Chamber of Inspiration & Respect</h2>
        <p>Where ideas became nourishment, and language became lanterns.</p>
        <div class="names-grid">
          <span>Ivan Illich</span>
          <span>Maria Montessori</span>
          <span>bell hooks</span>
          <span>Vandana Shiva</span>
          <span>Steve Jobs</span>
        </div>
      </section>
      
      <footer class="hall-footer">
        <p>“We did not burn in vain.”</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</NatureLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  .hall-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }
  
  .hall-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 6rem;
    
    h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #F4A460, #D35400);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-style: italic;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
  }
  
  .chamber {
    margin-bottom: 6rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);
    
    h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }
    
    p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      
      li {
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 20px;
      }
    }
    
    blockquote {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-style: italic;
      border-left: none;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }
  }
  
  .names-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    
    span {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
  
  .hall-footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 4rem;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: #D35400;
  }
</style>
